# Loads the `rust` devshell from flake.nix — pkg-config plus the GTK, D-Bus and
# PulseAudio libraries the -sys crates link against — whenever you enter the
# repository. Nix builds scripts/ with those supplied per derivation, but a
# plain shell has only the user profile on PATH, so without this `cargo` and the
# editor's rust-analyzer both fail in glib-sys' build script before reaching any
# of our code.
#
# Run `direnv allow` once after cloning.
use flake .#rust
